                                                "example_id": "04c76985-e99b-4687-9ddf-a7fda19ae307",
                                                "sense_id": "3cb531ab-ed0a-3084-bf4d-335eb94f2fbb",
                                                "text": "\"What is it, then?\" I asked. \"Drums,\" said Lord John, carelessly; \"war drums. I have heard them before.\" \"Yes, sir, war drums,\" said Gomez, the half-breed."
